{
  "$Comment": [
    "Grinding forward with the front edge buried. Loops, because how long a plough runs for is a variant setting and the clip cannot know it.",
    "The pitch grinds a few degrees deeper and shallower and rolls side to side over a couple of seconds, so the titan reads as shovelling through the ground rather than sliding across it at a fixed angle."
  ],
